{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "14th Single BACKSLIVE!!\n2日間ありがとうございました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私はこの活動をしていて\nあまり涙を流すことがありませんでした"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "周りのみんなが泣いている場面でも\n自分は泣けないことが多くて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そのたびに、\n自分はみんなと同じくらい\n頑張れていないのかなって\n思ってしまっていました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でもこの期間、 がむしゃらに頑張って\nたくさん悩んでたくさん涙を流しました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "苦しいこともあったけど\nその分ちゃんと自分と向き合えて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "少しだけ、自分のことを認めてあげられた気がします"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先輩方、同期、スタッフさん、\nそしてBuddiesのみなさんがいてくださるから\nいつでも前を向けます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "支えてくれてありがとうございます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobYuThJs.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ひいろと撮りあいっこしたよ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ふたりで同じ曲に苦戦していたのですが、たくさん確認しあって出番直前まで励ましあって\n乗り越えられたね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "1番この2日間で嬉しかったことはね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "公演が終わったあとに\n武元さんが「ちーちゃん、頑張ったね」と\n言ってくださったことです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "頑張れていたのかな、そうだったらいいな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mob8SjPzL.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "座長を務めてくださった美羽さん\nとってもかっこいい背中を見せてくださいました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どこまでもついていきます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobI6ftzw.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobJ7oeTN.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobEZpd6A.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobpEctA4.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobqWdG0I.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "うれしいたのしい写真たち"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "きらさんとは30枚くらいツーショットを撮ってもらったのですがそのうちの29枚は変顔されました\n奇跡の一枚です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後にお知らせです📢"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "6月2日、3日に開催される四期生ライブの\nチケット一般販売が始まっています！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "9人で力を合わせて素敵なものを作り上げられるよう精一杯頑張るので、是非来て下さると嬉しいです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://l-tike.com/concert/mevent/?mid=366800"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobGfDbl8.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ここまで、\n読んでくれてありがとうございました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また書きます🍀"}], "source": "official"}